/Title (7. Conclusion and Future Scope This IoT-based pothole detection and alert system offers an effective and automated solution to a pervasive urban problem. By leveraging low-cost sensors and cloud connectivity, the system provides real-time detection, precise localization, and immediate notification, significantly improving road safety and maintenance efficiency. The proactive nature of the system ensures that potholes can be addressed before they lead to serious incidents.)
